# Kubernetes triage

## Defaults

1. Resolve namespace from the user or current context — do not guess prod.
2. Order: workload status → events → logs (when needed).
3. Distinguish Pending, CrashLoopBackOff, ImagePullBackOff, OOMKilled.
4. Node pressure: use node summary/top tools when pods are Pending/evicted.
5. Keep reports short: object name, phase/reason, one next check.
